BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Couchiching Annual Conference 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T190000
UID:couchiching-annual-conference-2026-2026-10-07t08-30-00-04-00@agakhanmu
 seum.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.agakhanmuseum.org/uploads/2026/07
 /1710-AKM-Orhan-Pamuk-7110-scaled-aspect-ratio-1600-1000-scaled.jpg?resize
 =1584%2C990&gravity
DESCRIPTION:The Couchiching Conference\, co-hosted by the Canadian Interna
 tional Council (CIC) and the Aga Khan Museum\, aims to foster an inclusive
  dialogue on the evolving role of diplomacy on the international stage. Th
 is event will provide a platform for citizens\, journalists\, academics\, 
 and students to engage in meaningful discussions on international affairs\
 , reflecting our shared mission to give Canadians a voice in global matter
 s.\n\nCanada is entering a period defined by geopolitical uncertainty\, te
 chnological disruption\, and shifting alliances. This year’s Couchiching
  Conference will bring together policymakers\, industry leaders\, and glob
 al thinkers to explore the choices shaping Canada’s role in the world.
LOCATION:Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive\, Toronto\, ON M3C 1K1
URL:https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/couchiching-annual-conference-2026/
X-SOURCE:Aga Khan Museum
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
